				</div><div class="largetext" style="text-align:justify">The ownership percentage in this schedule is based upon an aggregate of 133,893,376 shares of Class A Common Stock and 150,983,449 shares of Class B Common Stock issued and outstanding as of August 5, 2025, as reported on the Issuer's Quarterly Report on Form 10-Q filed with the SEC on August 7, 2025.</div></div></div><div class="form1"><table><tr><td class="center"><br><br><p><div align="center" style="font-size:1.2em;">
